{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a09108fe00280244691f47d686911cd1b1e057f506664411514b8c2fb50228f0", "ja": "いや、そういう意味じゃなかったんだけど……。\nでもそれ、すごくいい衣装だろう？", "zh": "不，我没那个意思……\n不过，那套服装很棒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "98719b0bf8a6f029efcded42fe985daca7496699a8d147967e33dad8ede8bfd2", "ja": "よかったら、青羽さんに感想を伝えてあげて\nくれないか？　きっと喜ぶよ。", "zh": "你愿意把你的感想告诉青羽小姐吗？\n她一定会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0064_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "44f577dbad9cf3b2515a6fa17feab5be87b619ac3f279c86ca2bf45bd4af4d01", "ja": "は、はい！　もちろんです！", "zh": "好、好的！当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
