{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0064_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "b666c8ec0c51587125aa04558438bedaac8aaa2d3f3e4080cfacf4f7ee017375", "ja": "だから、その……私のために、\nありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "所以，那个……谢谢你为我订制服装，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_015siz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_015siz0064_1017_p", "source_sha256": "74bc3382d632fc1f821cdc65992906c332f18baf2720d5866f294455e85647af", "ja": "静香……。", "zh": "静香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
